"The complete source served locally: opening wave, hero and castle HUD.","src","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/crown-defender-codex.webp","alt","A hero defends a castle in Crown Defender’s isometric arena.","https://github.com/Aleksandr-Litvinenko/Codex.-Crown-Defender-TD-3D-browser-tower-defense-game","width",1280,"height",720,"credit","GameMap local capture","list","attribution","创作者记录中的客户端与模型","items",[86],"Codex","links","相关资源",[92,93],"resourceIds","section",{"_61":96,"_25":97},{"_61":94,"_25":95},"Three.js","/zh/resources/threejs/","OpenAI Codex","/zh/resources/codex/","创作者开发记录",[101],"evidence",{"_61":102,"_25":103,"_104":105},"查看作者的开发代理署名","https://github.com/Aleksandr-Litvinenko/Codex.-Crown-Defender-TD-3D-browser-tower-defense-game/blob/main/COMPARISON.md","note","Author-published Russian comparison explicitly states that Codex built this version from the same requirements as the Claude Code project; no raw session is published.","源码内容","complete project","项目源码",[110],{"_61":111,"_25":74,"_104":112},"查看完整 Codex 游戏项目","Includes game.js, interface, bundled Three.js, runtime textures, requirements and optional WebSocket relay. No build or dependency installation for solo play. MIT code; see ASSET_CREDITS.md.","获取方式","download","demo","试玩与运行",[118],{"_61":119,"_25":120,"_104":121},"Download and run Crown Defender","https://github.com/Aleksandr-Litvinenko/Codex.-Crown-Defender-TD-3D-browser-tower-defense-game/archive/refs/heads/main.zip","Static browser game. Run python3 -m http.server 8010 and open localhost:8010/index.html; choose Играть (Play). Russian interface. WASD/arrows move; semicolon attacks. Mobile joystick/buttons included. Optional two-player mode requires node server/multiplayer-server.mjs.","游戏平台","源码下载","指南形式","build log","tutorial","开发记录与教程",[129],{"_61":130,"_25":103,"_104":-7},"查看同一需求下的代理对比","研究这个工作流","ordered",true,[135,136,137,138],"Serve the project locally and enter TD Defense.","Read the original requirements and same-brief comparison.",